== b06_generic
  san:    exit 134 use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written|
  O3:     exit 0 generic 12|
  interp: exit 1 olang interpret: b06_generic.olang:33: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b06_generic.debug.san
--- run san
use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written
--- run O3
generic 12
--- interpret
olang interpret: b06_generic.olang:33: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed
